           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Branding Tips for San Marcos Businesses",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>If your customers are students, your logo should look great on T-shirts, stickers and Instagram.</li><li>Seasonal businesses benefit from a logo that works on merchandise sold during peak months.</li><li>Keep a one-color version for affordable screen printing.</li><li>Use the same logo across delivery apps, Google and social media.</li></ul>",
