           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "How San Marcos Clients Work With Logo Austin",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ol><li><strong>Call or message.</strong> Call 512-717-7453 or request a <a href=\"/consultation/\">free consultation</a>. No office visit is needed.</li><li><strong>Share your vision.</strong> Send your business name, services and any styles you like.</li><li><strong>Review concepts the same day.</strong> Multiple original concepts arrive by text or email, usually within hours.</li><li><strong>Approve and pay.</strong> Revise until it is right, then pay ($125 to $175) and receive your files.</li></ol><p>Logo Austin also serves nearby areas: <a href=\"/kyle-logo-design/\">Kyle</a>, <a href=\"/austin-logo-designers/\">Austin</a>, <a href=\"/del-valle-logo-design/\">Del Valle</a>.</p>",
