          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Do you design logos for San Marcos, TX businesses?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. San Marcos is one of Logo Austin's most frequent service areas, and all work is completed remotely.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can you design logos and T-shirts for student organizations?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin designs logos and T-shirt graphics for organizations and events, and provides print-ready and embroidery files.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a custom logo cost for a San Marcos business?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Logo Austin charges $125 to $175 for a custom logo, with no upfront payment. You pay only after approving the final design and receive JPG, PNG, SVG, PDF, AI and EPS files.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
